## Predict the Output

Consider the following Angular template and component data:

```ts
users = [
  { id: 1, name: 'Bablu', age: 22 },
  { id: 2, name: 'Mansoor', age: 25 }
];
```

```html
@for (user of users; track user.id) {
  <div>
    <p>Name: {{ user.name }}</p>
    <p>Age: {{ user.age }}</p>

    @if (user.age >= 25) {
      <p>Status: Eligible</p>
    } @else {
      <p>Status: Not Eligible</p>
    }
  </div>
}
```

