## Senior Developer Challenge - Debug the Performance Issue

Your team built an employee dashboard with 3,000 rows. Every few seconds, fresh data arrives from API. Users report UI lag and rows losing focus while typing.

Current template:

```html
@for (employee of employees; track employee) {
  <app-row [data]="employee"></app-row>
}
```

Each refresh creates a new array reference from API.

